    m_Alignment: 3
    m_AlignByGeometry: 0
    m_RichText: 0
    m_HorizontalOverflow: 0
    m_VerticalOverflow: 1
    m_LineSpacing: 1
  m_Text: "\u2022 Click or tap glowing parts, their labels, or the Parts list to
    explore them.\n\u2022 Drag on the model to turn it; use the View buttons or mouse
    wheel to zoom. Nothing needs two fingers.\n\u2022 Niko's abilities: SCAN identifies
    structures, INSIDE moves inside the eye, SIMULATE changes brightness or distance,
    TRACE follows light or signals, FREEZE stops the biology mid-action, REPLAY repeats
    a demonstration.\n\u2022 Replay explanation repeats Niko's last line. Pause stops
    everything; menus keep working.\n\u2022 Ask Niko answers questions about what
    you've explored so far."
